# Onboard parameters for Vehicle 1
#
# STAGE 1 - TELEM2 as MAVLink, to prove the UART wiring works.
#
# Load this FIRST. It puts TELEM2 back on MAVLink so mavproxy can see the FC.
# After loading: reboot the FC, then on the Jetson run
#     mavproxy.py --master=/dev/ttyTHS1,57600 --show-errors
# You should get a HEARTBEAT within a second or two.
# Baud is dropped to 57600 deliberately - more tolerant of marginal wiring
# than 921600 while you are still chasing a dead link (setup doc section 3).
#
# Vehicle-Id	Component-Id	Name	Value	Type
1	1	MAV_1_CONFIG	102	6
1	1	MAV_1_MODE	2	6
1	1	MAV_1_FLOW_CTRL	0	6
1	1	MAV_1_FORWARD	0	6
1	1	SER_TEL2_BAUD	57600	6
1	1	UXRCE_DDS_CFG	0	6
